{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>37歲無綫花旦陳瀅近日在台慶劇《璀璨之城》中上演破格大尺度戲份，更因為近乎全裸色誘對手而引爆極大網絡爭議。面對 …</p><p></p>\n<p>37歲無綫花旦陳瀅近日在台慶劇《璀璨之城》中上演破格大尺度戲份，更因為近乎全裸色誘對手而引爆極大網絡爭議。面對接踵而來的負面評價與抨擊，這位剛度過生日的女星並未有因此退縮。她選擇在社交平台作出一連串令人意想不到大膽舉動。</p>\n<h2>踏入37歲無懼負面評論高調飛往外地慶生</h2>\n<p>縱然外界對這場情慾戲份反應兩極，陳瀅本人卻選擇以冷處理方式應對。上星期剛剛踏入37歲，她懶理連日來種種爭議，早前先在社交平台曬出手捧巨型紅玫瑰花束燦爛笑容照片。直到10月27日，她進一步公開一連串充滿陽光與海灘度假靚相，並配文寫上「a week of wellness」，向大眾宣告自己正享受豐盛且健康無憂假期生活。</p>\n<h2>遠赴海島親近大自然陳瀅換上黑色比堅尼</h2>\n<p>翻看這輯外遊照片，可見她全程狀態輕鬆自在，未受半點輿論影響。她一時穿上綠色運動連身裙在球場上揮灑汗水打網球，一時又以條紋無肩帶上衣配搭牛仔褲親近大自然，甚至向大象擺出可愛獻吻表情及高舉香檳留影。最令目光聚焦一幕，是她大解放換上簡約黑色泳裝並戴上草帽，於泳池邊盡情吸收陽光，再漫步於清澈海水之中。</p>\n<h2>破格演出《璀璨之城》透視內衣色誘張智霖</h2>\n<p>陳瀅向來憑藉出眾外貌與豐滿身形獲封為不少人心目中女神，今次在台慶劇《璀璨之城》中迎來演藝生涯一大突破。劇中她穿上極具誘惑力黑色透視內衣，傾力演出色誘拍檔張智霖，當中有部分特寫鏡頭更營造出近乎全裸視覺震撼。這場極具衝擊力畫面一經播出，瞬間成為全城熱話，不過同時亦惹來尺度過火嚴厲批評。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179326417108068065_16257758446ae30a2c240d7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"missjni_1793162103_4017316260216788710_801727.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179326417108068065_16257758446ae30a2c240d7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@missjni）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179326417544626308_6881971906ae30a301462b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"missjni_1793162103_4017316260283938187_801727.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179326417544626308_6881971906ae30a301462b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@missjni）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179285790788072021_17531684596adcd73422f78.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 陳瀅 陳瀅的大尺度戲份近日成為熱話！（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179285790788072021_17531684596adcd73422f78.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳瀅的大尺度戲份近日成為熱話！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17932641797043176_14757303286ae30a3439fea.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"missjni_1793162103_4017316260309100293_801727.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17932641797043176_14757303286ae30a3439fea.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@missjni）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179326418293761892_6492873786ae30a3794d3d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"missjni_1793162103_4017316260283876795_801727.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179326418293761892_6492873786ae30a3794d3d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@missjni）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179326418763258514_6430301456ae30a3c13e95.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-1\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179326418763258514_6430301456ae30a3c13e95.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@missjni）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179326418975980223_12297067586ae30a3e3ee57.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"missjni_1793162103_4017316260208415218_801727.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179326418975980223_12297067586ae30a3e3ee57.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@missjni）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%bc%b5%e6%99%ba%e9%9c%96/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張智霖</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%92%80%e7%92%a8%e4%b9%8b%e5%9f%8e/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">璀璨之城</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e7%80%85/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳瀅</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3532164\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e6%97%85%e9%81%8a/%e6%97%85%e9%81%8a%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">旅遊熱話</a>\nOct 29 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T10:21:45.898332+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":863,"images":7,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T10:10:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T10:18:34.195694+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T10:18:34.195694+00:00","content_hash":"eed875bf6e56b5fd260ba913a4a0c08598391db88936dcf4d420c04df7f6f11f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}